# 클래스/슬롯 생성 시 자동으로 채워짐
@classId = {{createClass.response.body.data.id}}
@slotId = {{createSlot.response.body.data.id}}
@reservationId = {{createReservation.response.body.data.id}}

# ========== 0. 테스트 데이터 준비 (클래스 & 슬롯 생성) ==========

### 0-1. 클래스 생성 (판매자)
# @name createClass
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

예약테스트용클래스
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

헬스
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="level"

중급
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

예약 테스트를 위한 클래스입니다
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pricePoints"

5000
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="capacity"

10
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 0-2. 클래스 승인 (관리자)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 0-3. 슬롯 생성 (판매자)
# @name createSlot
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/{{classId}}/slots
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

{
  "date": "2026-03-28",
  "hour": 15,
  "capacity": 10,
  "isOpen": true
}

# ========== 예약 테스트 시작 ==========

### 1. [고객] 예약 생성
# @name createReservation
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "slotId": "{{slotId}}"
}

### 2. [고객] 내 예약 목록 조회 (전체)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 3. [고객] 내 예약 목록 조회 (BOOKED만)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?status=BOOKED
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 4. [고객] 예약 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 5. [고객] 예약 취소
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
  "cancelNote": "개인 사정으로 취소합니다"
}


### 6. [판매자] 주간 슬롯 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/seller/slots?startDate=2026-02-01&endDate=2026-02-28
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 7. [판매자] 내 센터 예약 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/seller/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 8. [판매자] 유저 예약 강제 취소
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/seller/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

{
  "cancelNote": "강사 사정으로 인한 휴강"
}

### 9. [판매자] 예약 완료 처리
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### 10. [관리자] 전체 예약 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/admin/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. [관리자] 예약 통계
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/admin/reservations/stats?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. [관리자] 예약 강제 취소
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reservations/admin/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "cancelNote": "운영 정책 위반"
}

### 13. [고객] 예약 생성 - 포인트 부족 (보유 0원)
# seed에서 생성된 빈털털이 고객 (poor@test.com)
@poorCustomerToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InRlc3QtcG9vci1jdXN0b21lci1pZC0wMSIsImVtYWlsIjoicG9vckB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJDVVNUT01FUiIsImlhdCI6MTczNTY4OTYwMCwiZXhwIjoyMDUxMDQ5NjAwfQ.7FYriw6LgX4kgWh2Q6nyKreWyL_yB5u1bC1OQTBQjEA
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{poorCustomerToken}}

{
  "slotId": "{{slotId}}"
}

### 14. [고객] 예약 상세 조회 - 권한 없음
# 다른 사용자의 예약 조회 시도 (403 Forbidden 예상)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

